! mcp_bootstrap_p49.strap -- RESERVATIONS, TABLES AND COUNTERS
! continued, printed page 49.  docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.56,
! header "PAGE NUMBER 49".  docs/boot_plan.md M3.
!
! EIGHT LINES, and the shortest page this project has transcribed.
! It finishes the DECODE program's storage block that printed p.48
! opened: four index words, a self-refilling clear word, a
! four-word count table and one more index word.
!
! >>> IT STARTS AT 002602.00 AND THAT IS A ROUNDING, not a new
! origin. <<<
!
! printed p.48's last datum is line 52's "L INFAD  DD(BU,1),0" at
! 002601.73 -- ONE BIT, ending at 002601.74 -- and an XW rounds to
! the next full word.  There is no SLC on this page at all; the
! location counter simply carries over from the page before, which
! is what a single STRAP assembly looks like when the listing's page
! break falls mid-deck.  This deck states 002602.00 outright, as
! every page deck here does.
!
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! LINE 5 IS A SELF-REFILLING CLEAR WORD
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! "L CLEAR  XW,L RLCT,4,$" prints "002607.00+ 000 000004 002606" --
! value L RLCT, count four, refill ITSELF -- which is printed p.48
! lines 9-18's shape again.  The count is the four words line 6
! reserves, so the two rows state the same number twice and the
! deck checks them against each other.
!
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! SUBSTITUTIONS
! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! (1) BLANKS INSIDE SYMBOL NAMES ARE DROPPED, as on every page since
!     p.2: L SAVE, L SAVEY, L SAVEZ, L PUT, L CLEAR, L RLCT and
!     LAST PP.
!
! (2) NOTHING ELSE.  Lines 1 and 4 are a bare "XW", lines 2 and 3
!     "XW,0" and line 8 "XW," -- three spellings of the same null
!     value field, all written as printed, all compiling the same
!     all-zero index word (C22-6531 printed p.7: "A null field is
!     always compiled as a zero").  THAT THE LISTING USES ALL THREE
!     ON ONE PAGE is the best evidence this project has that they
!     are interchangeable.

        SLC, (8)2602.0

LSAVE   XW                          ! line 1  -TO SAVE LXNT INDEX
LSAVEY  XW, 0                       ! line 2
LSAVEZ  XW, 0                       ! line 3
LPUT    XW                          ! line 4
LCLEAR  XW, LRLCT, 4, $             ! line 5  -XW
LRLCT   DRZ(BU,64), (4)             ! line 6  -RLSYM COUNT TABLE
LASTPP  XW,                         ! line 8  -ADD. OF LAST PP
                                     !           ENTERED IN TBL

        END, LSAVE

! ---------------------------------------------------------------
! AND ONE LISTING MARK, the bare "*" after the location that every
! page since printed p.3 carries: line 6 ("002607.00 *").
